---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Lost" description="This page doesn't exist.">
  <main id="main" class="lost">
    <p class="kick"><span class="bn" lang="bn">হারিয়ে গেছি</span> 404</p>
    <h1>Lost is an honest answer.</h1>
    <p>This page doesn't exist, and I'd rather say so than guess where you meant to go. A tracker that names the wrong target confidently is worse than one that reports it lost.</p>
    <p class="aside">On a scale of one to ten, how would you rate your link? Either way, the way home is below.</p>
    <p class="go"><a class="pill" href="/">Back to the system</a><a class="pill ghost" href="/everything">All the work</a><a class="pill ghost" href="/notes">The notes</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
<style>
  .lost { min-height: 88svh; display: grid; place-content: center; justify-items: start; padding: 8rem var(--gutter, 1.4rem) 4rem; max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  .kick { display: flex; gap: .8rem; align-items: baseline; margin: 0 0 .6rem; font: 400 var(--t-1) var(--mono); color: var(--dim); }
  .kick .bn { font: 400 var(--t1) var(--bangla); color: #ffcf8a; }
  h1 { font: 600 clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem)/1.1 var(--sans); margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  p { font: 400 var(--t0)/1.65 var(--sans); color: #d0d0d0; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .aside { color: var(--dim); font-size: var(--t-1); }
  .go { display: flex; gap: .6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: .6rem; }
</style>
